  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "a1.numbers.note-teen-ty",
      "competence": "a1.numbers",
      "title": {
        "en": "Thirteen or thirty?",
        "bg": "Thirteen или thirty?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Numbers 13 to 19 end in -teen: thirteen, fourteen, fifteen. Tens end in -ty: thirty, forty, fifty. Listen to the stress: thirTEEN (13) but THIRty (30). Watch the spelling: twelve, fifteen, fifty, and forty (no \"u\", not \"fourty\"). Between tens and ones we write a hyphen: twenty-one, forty-five. 100 is \"one hundred\" or \"a hundred\".",
        "bg": "Числата от 13 до 19 завършват на -teen: thirteen, fourteen, fifteen. Десетиците завършват на -ty: thirty, forty, fifty. Слушай ударението: thirTEEN (13), но THIRty (30). Внимавай с правописа: twelve, fifteen, fifty и forty (без \"u\", не \"fourty\"). Между десетиците и единиците пишем тире: twenty-one, forty-five. 100 е \"one hundred\" или \"a hundred\"."
      },
      "examples": [
        "Ten, eleven, twelve.",
        "I'm thirteen.",
        "Ten, twenty, thirty.",
        "Seventy, eighty, ninety, one hundred."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1.numbers.note-age-phone",
      "competence": "a1.numbers",
      "title": {
        "en": "Age and phone numbers",
        "bg": "Възраст и телефонни номера"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "For age, English uses \"be\", not \"have\": \"How old are you?\" — \"I'm twenty.\" or \"I'm twenty years old.\" Don't stop after \"years\": \"I'm twenty years\" is wrong. In Bulgarian we say \"На двадесет години съм\", but in English there is no \"на\", and \"old\" is needed after \"years\". For phone numbers, say each number one by one: 0888 412 739 = \"oh eight eight eight, four one two, seven three nine\". 0 is \"oh\" or \"zero\".",
        "bg": "За възраст английският използва \"be\" (съм), а не \"have\" (имам): \"How old are you?\" — \"I'm twenty.\" или \"I'm twenty years old.\" Не спирай след \"years\": \"I'm twenty years\" е грешно. На български казваме \"На двадесет години съм\", но на английски няма \"на\", а след \"years\" трябва \"old\". Телефонните номера казваш цифра по цифра: 0888 412 739 = \"oh eight eight eight, four one two, seven three nine\". 0 се казва \"oh\" или \"zero\"."
      },
      "examples": [
        "How old are you?",
        "I'm twenty years old.",
        "What's your phone number?",
        "It's oh eight eight eight, four one two, seven three nine."
      ]
    }
  ],
